WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:04.730
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.430
Satoshi, come and help me!

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:24.410
Coming!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.660
This one, too!

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:34.830
Sorry! I should’ve warned you
they were broken.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.240
I’ve already called the handymen.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.800
Handymen?

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.640
We’ll fix it right away.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.310
Thank you.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.280
A Plusle and a Minun!

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:58.130
Plusle! Minun! Cheering Pokémon!
Electric type!

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.490
They cheer on their friends
with pom-poms made of sparks!

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:06.170
If their friends are losing,
their bodies let off more and more sparks!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:08.710
Oh, they’re cute.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:12.440
Plusle and Minun are
our mascot Pokémon.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.340
Here!

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.200
From plumbing...

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.090
...to Pokémon-sitting...

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.190
You can leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:21.660
The Plusle and Minun Handymen!

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.940
The ‘hole lot?

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.270
Yes, the ‘hole lot.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.500
Mulply.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.770
Here, Big Brother.

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.380
Umm...

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:32.290
I’m sorry!
I forgot the extension cord!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.820
Plusle!
Use Discharge on the dryer!

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:35.880
Go for it.

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:45.080
All right! Thanks, Plusle, Minun.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.000
Thank you very much.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.690
If you ever need the
Plusle and Minun Handymen again...

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:57.350
Give us a call!

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.280
Thank you!

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.850
Okay, now for the next job—

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.770
Big Brother!

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.350
B-Be careful!

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.300
Oh, no!

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:14.470
Are you okay?!

00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:15.360
Big Brother...

00:03:56.490 --> 00:04:02.040
Satoshi and Go have taken Divi,
the injured handyman, to the hospital.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.070
I’m sorry...

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:05.790
It’s fine, it’s fine.

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:08.060
I’m glad you’re not hurt, Mulply.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.850
Don’t worry, I’ll be okay.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.310
I’m really, really sorry!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.900
But... You’re going to have
to handle any jobs on your own.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.730
Huh? On my own?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.440
No way, I can’t do that!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.700
I can’t handle both our tasks!

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.960
If you just relax and try it,
you’ll be fine.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.350
You’ll have Plusle and Minun, too.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:36.880
Minun’s angry...

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.480
That’s right...

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:41.470
Minun is particularly
attached to you...

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.180
I’m sorry, Minun.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:47.180
If you start panicking,
even easy jobs will seem impossible.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.760
Just relax.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:56.250
Yes, the Plusle and Minun
Handymen here.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:01.230
Got it!
Leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.780
Mulply, we have a job.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.310
But...

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:07.130
Um... I can help her!

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:07.860
Me too!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.240
Huh?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.790
We’re always
taking care of Pokémon!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.500
We should be able to do something!

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:19.830
From... plumbing...
to Pokémon... sitting...

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.920
L-L-L...

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.770
Leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:26.010
The Plusle and Minun Handymen!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.760
That’s it, you’ve got it.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.820
Thanks! I’ll try my best!

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.480
From plumbing to Pokémon-sitting...

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.550
You can leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.770
The Plusle and Minun Handymen!

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.440
Sorry for the wait!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:48.870
To get straight to the point,
can you help groom my Pokémon?

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.780
<i>You can leave the ‘hole lot to us!</i>

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:54.660
Ooh! Kentauros!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.160
And there’s so many!

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:59.510
Okay then, should we split up
and start brushing them?

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:00.490
Yeah!

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.940
Here you go. Just keep still...

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.920
Does that feel nice?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:15.060
I’ll make your fur all silky!

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:26.360
Ooh! They’re so silky!

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:30.510
Thank you! I’ll call you again!

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:31.910
Please do!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.050
You were both great!

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.260
It was easy!

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:36.410
Naturally, yeah.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.510
Plusle, thanks for cheering us on.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.610
You too, Minun.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:47.040
Yes, the Plusle and Minun
Handymen here!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.140
Got it!
Leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.260
That’s our next job! Let’s go!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.140
Yeah!

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.480
From plumbing to Pokémon-sitting...

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.260
You can leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:05.380
The Plusle and Minun Handymen!

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:06.730
Sorry for the wait!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.470
Oh, I’ve been waiting for you!

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:12.200
I lost my Kentauros
going through the tunnel!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.980
Kentauros again?

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.410
You need us to find it?

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.430
Leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.660
Whoa, it’s pitch black.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.370
You can’t see anything.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.750
Plusle, help us out!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.680
Thank you, Plusle!

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.800
Okay then, let’s go.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.310
Kentauros!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.960
Come on out!

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.310
There it is!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.890
So that’s where it was hiding.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.990
Come on,
let’s head outside together.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:51.820
Don’t be scared.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.410
All right,
let’s cheer it on, too!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.440
Hey!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:21.020
I-I’ve gotta stop it! No!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.400
Run for it!

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:31.360
It’s okay now...
You must’ve been scared...

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.230
Thank you!

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.600
Call us again!

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:39.490
Sorry, everyone...

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:44.370
Why do I always start panicking...?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.580
You just need to get used to it, yeah?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.450
Try taking deep breaths!

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.920
Thanks, Go, Satoshi...

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:54.130
You too, Plusle.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.390
Minun...

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:00.910
I’ll do better on the next job,
so just watch me, Minun!

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.770
What’s with all the Kentauros?!

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.630
He’s showing off.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.770
I wish he’d share a few with us.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:12.010
Not just “a few”...
I’d like to take ‘em all!

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.110
But how?

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.600
There’s the question.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.490
I’ll go have a drink.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.960
H-H-Hey! Hold on!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.640
The side, the side’s leaking too!

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.340
This is bad, meow.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.840
This isn’t my fault!

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:34.840
That’s it, meow!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:38.330
Yes! Understood!
Leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:40.470
Emergency, emergency, meow!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.720
Broken pipe! Emergency, meow!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.090
Um, um, um...

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.400
What— what do I do?!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.110
What do I do?

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.530
W-Water?!
What am I gonna do?!
We’re back.

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:52.150
Ack! The brat boy...
W-Water?!
What am I gonna do?!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.730
Huh? What happened?

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.200
The d-drinking fountain
went crazy...

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.100
Whoa, we gotta fix it!

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.660
Mulply, get a hold of yourself!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.660
R-Right...

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:09.580
I’ve <i>got</i> to get a grip!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.610
Um... Get my tools ready.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:17.470
Right!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:30.290
Since when are
the brat boys plumbers?!

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:32.860
When I called that handyman over,
they came too, meow.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.890
We fixed it somehow...

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:39.650
Yeah...

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:41.870
Thank you, both of you!

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:45.420
It’s nothing.
You did most of the work, Mulply.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:47.740
Really? You think so?

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:57.270
Yes, the Plusle and Minun
Handymen here!

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.720
Oh, thank you!

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:03.130
Understood.
One hour from now, right?

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.680
You can leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.520
Was that a job?

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:09.310
Yes, from that Kentauros lover
from earlier.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:12.080
He wants us to look after
his Kentauros.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:15.640
The job’s in one hour,
so let’s have lunch in the meantime!

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:16.310
Okay!

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:18.400
Gotta have a good meal
to keep us going!

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.990
You hear that?

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.110
Sure did.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:21.920
Excuse me!

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.530
Ack!

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:27.190
From plumbing to Pokémon-sitting.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:31.040
If you ever need help, you can count on
the Plusle and Minun Handymen!

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:35.340
This is it.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.930
We’ll get right to work, too!

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:40.310
You mean we should make money
by fixing pipes?

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:41.610
Not that!

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.970
The Kentauros, the Ke-n-tau-ro-s!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:49.230
I get it! We get there first,
and take the ‘hole lot, meow!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.740
Oh! Nice idea!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:56.430
Pocket Monsters!

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:08.990
Huh? You already gave them to us?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:13.620
They said they were handymen,
so I thought they were your staff.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.920
We don’t have any other staff.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:18.210
Maybe it was some other handymen?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.180
Then they took the wrong Pokémon?

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:21.600
When did you hand them over?

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:22.760
Just a moment ago.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:25.230
That means they should still be close by.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.430
Did anything stand out
about them?

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.680
Now you mention it...
They had a bicycle cart.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.170
A bicycle cart?

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:36.310
That went well, meow!

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:40.120
If we keep this up,
we can get loads of Pokémon!

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.820
Sakaki’s going to
be feeling great!

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.120
Excuse me!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.700
Ack!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.550
You’re handymen, right?

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:55.600
There’s something
we’d like to ask you.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.200
Did you pick up
the wrong Pokémon?

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:02.050
Apparently you got the Pokémon
we were supposed to be taking care of.

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:03.800
Ack, ack!

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.060
Did you take the job?

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:08.180
Huh? They look kinda familiar...

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:10.660
Whatever could you
be talking about?!

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:13.350
We are the Anyway and Anyhow
Handymen!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:18.180
These are our Pokémon we caught
by anyway and anyhow, meow!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.160
“Meow”?

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.100
Ack!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:22.770
They seem kinda suspicious.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:24.320
Who exactly are you?!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.700
If you say “Who exactly are you?!”...

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:36.670
We’ll answer out of
sympathy for the world!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.710
To protect the world from devastation.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.630
To preserve world peace.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.880
Championing the evils
of truth and love.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.840
We’re the lovely, charming villains.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.190
Musashi!

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:51.310
Kojiro!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.770
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:58.150
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:00.270
Just kidding, meow!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.170
Team Rocket!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.830
The Nyarth is talking!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.820
Yeah, that is what stands out.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.410
They’re always doing this stuff!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.630
Well, <i>sorry</i> for doing this stuff, meow!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.790
We’re not giving these Pokémon back!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.910
That said...

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.370
We’ll leave while we’re ahead, meow!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.540
<i>See ya!</i>

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:33.740
Wh-What?!

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:34.890
Nyarth!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.320
Move, meow, Kentauros!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:43.270
What do we do, what do we do,
what do we do?!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.750
For crying out loud...

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.150
Let’s save him, Go.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:49.110
Hey! Are you okay?

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.780
Whoa... It’s stuffed full
of Kentauros...

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:54.420
Mulply, do you have
any ropes or anything?

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:56.290
Huh? Um, er...

00:14:56.650 --> 00:15:00.290
Ropes... Ropes... R-R-Ropes...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.790
They’re too heavy, meow!

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:07.450
From plumbing...
to Pokémon-sitting...

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.680
You can leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:20.810
Go. Satoshi.
There’s a winch on the van.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:22.380
A winch?

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:25.250
Let’s begin by
pulling up the Kentauros.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:27.150
You two get the rope
and bring it to the hole.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.650
Right!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:32.730
Then, lay one of those steel pipes across the hole,
and stabilise it with the sandbags.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:33.470
Right!

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:35.600
Like that?

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.610
Hang the rope over the pipe,
then lower it.

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:38.560
Right!

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.370
We’re gonna save you now!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:46.310
Someone needs to go down there
to wind the rope around the Kentauros.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:48.040
Okay, I’ll do it.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.270
Hold on. I’ll go.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:51.340
Mulply...

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.670
This is my job.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:56.490
I can’t let you
put yourselves in danger.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:58.890
That’s what my brother would say,
if he was here.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:05.100
When the Kentauros reach the top,
you two should lead them somewhere safe.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.250
Got it.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.270
You over there.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.450
Can I ask you to operate the winch?

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.940
Me?!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:13.230
Hmph. Don’t go
ordering people around.

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:17.430
However, I just so <i>happen</i> to be
in the mood for using a winch.

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:19.120
What a coincidence.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.640
Everything’s fine.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:38.800
I’ll get you out now.

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:43.180
Okay! Pull it up!

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:43.850
Right!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:46.360
Switch... On!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.550
Stop!

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:55.160
Right!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.460
Okay, over here...

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:58.330
Easy does it...

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.740
Rescue complete!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.960
Now for the next one!
Pass the rope down!

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:02.500
Right!

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.340
H-Hurry it up, meow...

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.350
Hold on a bit longer.

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:51.630
You’re safe now.
Don’t worry.

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.580
The next one is the last one?

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:56.250
Yes! This is the last Kentauros!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:56.970
All right!

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:57.820
Pull it up!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:58.590
Right!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:02.810
Gently, meow...

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:06.810
Huh?

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:09.310
The battery!

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:19.820
Mulply!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.490
Are you okay?

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.080
S-Somehow...

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.590
I can do this!

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:41.910
Let’s all pull together!

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:42.620
Yeah!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:43.550
We’ll help!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:45.100
Heave... ho!

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:54.320
Minun?

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:57.860
Minun...

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.570
I won’t give in!

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:03.950
Winch... please work!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.460
They’re too heavy...!

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:11.880
Ah, Minun!

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:18.670
Oh! Will that work?!

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:24.680
No good!
There’s not enough power!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.060
Power? In that case...

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:30.360
Pikachu! Use 100,000 Volts
on Plusle and Minun!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.610
Okay! Use Discharge together!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:49.000
This... might just work!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.840
Meow... I’m saved, meow...

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.610
What a relief!
Nyarth!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:12.430
Minun.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:17.610
I heard you cheering for me.

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.250
Thank you too, Plusle.

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:27.820
Honestly, you put in
far too much effort.

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:31.120
Now that you’re all tired out,
we’ll be making off with the ‘hole lot!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.110
You creeps...!

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.630
You still haven't given up?!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.380
Just kidding.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:39.470
We’ll let you off, just for today.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.800
We’ll leave, out of respect
for that handyman.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.040
Thank you for rescuing me...

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:47.470
...is something
I <i>won’t</i> be saying, meow.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:50.080
Hah, what a waste of effort.

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.830
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.110
Mulply was amazing!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:08.030
Everyone worked together
under her lead!

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.980
I’m glad to hear it went well.

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:17.790
Yeah! It’s all thanks to everyone there,
and Plusle and Minun cheering me on!

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.430
I can’t wait to get back to work.

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:23.540
I’m counting on you!

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:24.590
Yeah!

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.320
From plumbing...

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.030
...to Pokémon-sitting!

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:29.930
You can leave the ‘hole lot to us!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.660
The Plusle and Minun Handymen!

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:36.630
Mulply managed to
face up to her faults.

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:39.600
Together with Divi, Plusle, and Minun,

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:42.830
they have a bright future
as handymen.

